### 4. Robust Sync Strategy: Queueing
Instead of sending requests immediately, use a **Queue Manager**. This handles edge cases like re-authentication or server downtime.

```javascript
// A robust approach: Use a dedicated task queue
const processQueue = async () => {
  const queue = await getPendingItems();

  // Use a sequential loop to respect server rate limits
  for (const item of queue) {
    const success = await attemptUpload(item);
    if (success) {
      await markAsSynced(item.id);
    } else {
      break; // Stop queue if API is down
    }
  }
};
```

