### 4. Making the App "Installable" (Service Worker)
To ensure the app files (JS/CSS/HTML) load while offline, you must use a Service Worker. Use **Workbox** to generate this:

```javascript
// Inside your workbox-config.js
module.exports = {
  globDirectory: 'build/',
  globPatterns: ['**/*.{html,js,css,png,svg}'],
  swDest: 'build/sw.js',
  // This caches the app shell so it loads without internet
  runtimeCaching: [{
    urlPattern: /\.(?:png|jpg|jpeg|svg)$/,
    handler: 'CacheFirst',
  }],
};
```

