    Order order;
    while (true) {
        if (incoming.pop(order)) {
            // Hot Path: Decision logic here
            order.price += 0.01; 
            outgoing.push(order);
        }
        // Busy wait (no sleep!) to keep CPU hot
    }
}
```

### 3. CPU Pinning (Linux Specific)
To prevent the OS from interrupting your execution, you must bind your threads to isolated CPU cores.

```cpp
