#### C. NUMA Awareness
If your server has two CPUs, a packet arriving on a NIC connected to PCIe lane "CPU 0" must be processed by a core on "CPU 0". Crossing the QPI/UPI bus to "CPU 1" will drop your packet rate significantly due to latency.

