*   **Packet Capture:** [AF_XDP](https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/networking/af_xdp.html) (Best for Linux native performance).
*   **Parsing:** [P4](https://p4.org/) or [BPF](https://ebpf.io/) (Compile packet filters directly into the kernel NIC driver).
*   **Hardware Acceleration:** If you move to 10Gbps+, consider **SmartNICs** (Mellanox/NVIDIA ConnectX series) which can offload the flow classification to the hardware via **OVS-TC (Traffic Control) offload**.

