Never process one packet at a time. The provided code uses a burst size of 32 packets. This amortizes the cost of the NIC register reads and keeps the CPU instruction pipeline full.

#### D. The "Flow Table" Bottleneck
For gigabit scale, tracking millions of flows is the bottleneck.
