if (rawValue < 5 || rawValue > 1018) {
    // Handle error (e.g., trigger fault light/log error)
}
```

#### 4. Power Management
If your firmware is battery-powered, your code must put the microcontroller to **Sleep mode** between readings. Look into `ESP.deepSleep()` (for ESP32) or `LowPower.h` (for AVR/Arduino) to drastically increase battery life.

