If your server needs to fetch data (e.g., from an external API), your bottleneck is the **network latency**.
*   Use **Keep-Alive** (HTTP persistent connections) to avoid the overhead of a 3-way TCP handshake for every request.
*   Use **HTTP/2 or HTTP/3** to multiplex multiple requests over a single TCP connection.

